  "spec": "STATUS 2026-07-07 (code audit): the surface-red half is built — hasCriteriaRegression (web/src/awaitingEval.ts, commit 3c88d7aa) flags any node marked Achieved whose criterion's met flag is no longer true, rendered as the reddish CRITERIA_REGRESSION background/border (web/src/styles.ts, argsForDrawBackgroundColor/Border). The trigger today is a VERDICT FLIP recorded by a human or agent (un-checking a criterion, or an agent posting a fail via propose_edits), NOT an automatic re-run: task 1 (re-run when work changes — relies on the executable-criterion runner, unbuilt) and task 3 (ancestor tinting) remain open, so the 'up the branch' completion criterion also remains unmet.",
