tion this node defines. Added a fifth task noting the labels were rewritten, and refreshed the human criterion's evidence to point at this node as the live demonstration.\\n\\nOne thing to flag honestly: `modified-code` is uniform across all three, so the labels don't yet distinguish much beyond \\\"it's code.\\\" That's fine for \\\"free form for now\\\" — but if you'd rather they carry a finer kind (say `component` / `pure-module` / `styles`), tell me the vocabulary you want and I'll set them. Nothing commits until you Confirm.\",\"timestamp\":1782968724753,\"toolCalls\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_01ACHoVwmLBdiTF4VvanKeE7\",\"title\":\"\",\"status\":\"completed\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"tree exported, so commit the change and the updated treee\",\"timestamp\":1782969052225},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":\"↻ sent updated tree\",\"timestamp\":1782969052225},{\"role\":\"agent\",\"content\":\"\",\"timestamp\":1782969052225}],\"agentName\":\"@agentclientprotocol/claude-agent-acp\"}"
