  "outcome": "When an LLM proposes connections (or other low-level entries) through the API, the system fills in the required fields the agent has no way to know and validates the shape before anything reaches the Holochain zome — so a propose→confirm round-trip can never fail at the Ribosome with an opaque deserialize error. The agent supplies the meaningful fields (parent, child, sibling order); the system supplies what only it can know (a randomizer, isImported=false) and rejects truly malformed input with a clear, human-readable message.",
  "spec": "The zome's Connection entry requires {parentActionHash, childActionHash, siblingOrder:i32, randomizer:i64, isImported:bool}. At the propose_edits boundary and/or in applyProjectDiffToCell: default randomizer and isImported=false when the agent omits them, validate the remaining fields, and surface invalid/unresolved connections to the human up front rather than letting them reach create_connection. Same hardening for any other entry type an agent can author. DISCOVERED 2026-06-18: an agent-authored connection missing randomizer/isImported committed its outcomes, then failed at happ/zomes/projects/src/project/connection/crud.rs with Deserialize(...), leaving orphan nodes.\n\nIMPLEMENTED 2026-06-18: pure helpers completeConnection / completeConnectionsInDiff (fill randomizer i64 + isImported=false + siblingOrder default; idempotent, distinct randomizer per connection) and validateConnections (rejects missing/empty parent or child with a clear message) live in projectDiff.ts. Wired at three boundaries: (1) propose_edits (acornTools.ts) rejects malformed connections up front, returning ok:false with a clear message and opening NO draft; (2) the draft completion step (draftReview.ts completeProposedDiff) completes connections so the draft is committable, and confirmDraft refuses a malformed draft before any write; (3) internalApplyProjectDiffToCell (applyProjectDiff.ts) is the last line before the zome — covers the file-import path too — completing connections and throwing a clear error on the malformed instead of an opaque Ribosome Deserialize.",
