{
  "outcome": "The live ACP chat session — its user and assistant turns, the tool calls and proposed edits within them, the agent's evolving plan, and the node(s) in focus when each question was asked — is captured into a single serializable transcript record keyed to the session, so the conversation that shaped a branch can be retained verbatim rather than reconstructed after the fact.",
  "spec": "Capture the HarnessChat stream into a transcript: ordered turns {role, content, timestamp?, thinking?, toolCalls?, selection?}, serializable to JSON for storage in a conversation artifact.\n\nTwo things beyond message text are captured because they are otherwise lost: (1) the agent `plan` stream (replace-wholesale, not tied to a turn) is captured SEPARATELY as session-level timestamped snapshots (Transcript.planSnapshots = [{at, entries}]); (2) the node(s) SELECTED WHEN a user message was sent — the ask-time anchor — pinned on the user turn (turn.selection), since selection is live state the human moves while the agent works.\n\nIMPLEMENTED 2026-06-30: web/src/harness/transcript.ts — Transcript {version, sessionId, agentName?, title, capturedAt, turns[], planSnapshots?}; buildTranscript / serializeTranscript / parseTranscript round-trip losslessly (parse normalizes drifted turns/snapshots/selections, rejects non-transcript input); proposedEdits(t) derives propose_edits refs; anchorSelection(t) returns the FIRST user turn's selection (the attach-leaf no-edits anchor). Capture made real at the source: chatHistory.ts ChatMessage gains `at` + `toolCalls` + `selection` (ChatSelection = {actionHash,id,content?}); SessionRecord gains `planSnapshots`, threaded through upsertSession/persistTurn/migrateSession + getSessionPlanSnapshots. HarnessChat: stamps `at`; records tool_calls; captures readSelection() at SEND TIME onto the user turn (never re-read later); appends a plan snapshot on every ACP `plan` update; persists + restores + resets snapshots with the session.",
  "completionCriteria": [
    {
      "statement": "A chat session serializes to a transcript and parses back, preserving turn order, roles and content (pure, unit-tested)",
      "evaluator": "executable",
      "met": true,
      "by": "uhCAk6NMsJYZovJRS4CRK3hQsv5bN5pWENojRKPEA3x8grOccqulR",
      "at": 1782845400000,
      "evidence": "2026-06-30: web/test/transcript.test.ts round-trip suite proves parseTranscript(serializeTranscript(buildTranscript(session))) deep-equals the transcript and preserves turn order + roles + content (incl. empty session); normalizes a drifted turn; rejects non-transcript JSON. Full suite + chatHistory.test.ts: 33/33 pass; tsc clean on touched files."
    },
    {
      "statement": "plan updates are captured as timestamped session-level snapshots that round-trip through serialize/parse, preserving the order in which the plan changed (pure, unit-tested)",
      "evaluator": "executable",
      "met": true,
      "by": "uhCAk6NMsJYZovJRS4CRK3hQsv5bN5pWENojRKPEA3x8grOccqulR",
      "at": 1782849990000,
      "evidence": "2026-06-30: transcript.test.ts 'plan snapshots' suite — buildTranscript carries SessionRecord.planSnapshots onto Transcript.planSnapshots in order (pending→completed across two snapshots) and they survive serialize/parse; omitted cleanly when none. HarnessChat appends {at, entries} on each ACP `plan` update (planSnapshotsRef), persisted via persistTurn and restored on resume."
    },
    {
      "statement": "Each user turn records the node(s) selected at send-time, and that ask-time selection round-trips through serialize/parse and is unaffected by selection changing afterward (pure, unit-tested)",
      "evaluator": "executable",
      "met": true,
      "by": "uhCAk6NMsJYZovJRS4CRK3hQsv5bN5pWENojRKPEA3x8grOccqulR",
      "at": 1782849990000,
      "evidence": "2026-06-30: transcript.test.ts 'ask-time selection' suite — per-user-turn selection {actionHash,id,content?} round-trips; anchorSelection(t) returns the FIRST user turn's selection (uhFIRST), not the latest (uhLATER), proving the anchor is fixed at ask-time independent of later turns/navigation; malformed selection (missing actionHash) is dropped. The value is captured PURELY from the stored message (HarnessChat reads readSelection() at send time and pins it), so it cannot drift. 33/33 tests pass; tsc clean."
    }
  ],
  "artifacts": [
    {
      "type": "workproduct",
      "label": "transcript.ts — Transcript + planSnapshots + per-turn selection; buildTranscript / serialize / parse / proposedEdits / anchorSelection",
      "uri": "web/src/harness/transcript.ts"
